Z||000000||Wolfhound||06-12-2001||03:13 PM||||Well, My paint is done, new original blue.<BR>Painted by Allen Ruff and Chris Johnson.<BR> They were a few minor problems that thanks to a good ethical bussiness were self correcting. A bit of moisture got in the upper surface clear coat and when I returned from Huntsville they were sanding for a repaint. Went by this morning and took a photo as they removed the masking.   <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mask.JPG">  <BR>And another as it was rolled out of the booth! <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/out.JPG">  <BR>I went to get the taillight lense and when I came back Allen was resanding the rear deck lid to repaint. He had made a 1 1/2 inch scratch reinstalling the Wing. He said I want it prefect when it leaves here. You can't argue with service like that. you can read a newspaper in the finish straight out of the spray booth. Beautiful!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 06-12-2001).]||||reg||6
